OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,FWorld Cup 2026 co-hosts the United
OL,7,FStates have been knocked out of the
OL,8,Ftournament following a 4-1 defeat to
OL,9,FBelgium in Seattle.
OL,11,FIt comes despite an intervention by US
OL,12,FPresident Donald Trump, who took
OL,13,Fcredit for getting FIFA to review a
OL,14,Fred card issued against USA star
OL,15,Fforward Folarin Balogun.
OL,17,FFIFA lifted his suspension for
OL,18,FMonday's round of 16 match, but
OL,19,Fultimately, his presence on the pitch
OL,20,Fdid little to secure a spot in the
OL,21,Fquarter finals for the United States.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,FIn an apparent reference the decision
OL,7,Fafter what Trump described as a phone
OL,8,Fcall with FIFA President Gianni
OL,9,FInfantino, the Belgian national men's
OL,10,Fteam shared photos of their triumphant
OL,11,Fplayers on X with the caption:
OL,12,F"Overturn this."
OL,14,FThe team also appeared to dance in a
OL,15,Fsimilar style to President Trump
OL,16,Ffollowing their fourth goal against
OL,17,Fthe United States.
OL,26,@tD@AOUtD@PO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,FBelgium opened the scoring in the
OL,7,Fninth minute, with Charles De
OL,8,FKetelaere capitalising on some sloppy
OL,9,Fdefending to tap in a pass deep in the
OL,10,Fbox.
OL,12,FThe hosts looked outpaced early, but
OL,13,Frelieved some pressure at the half-
OL,14,Fhour mark when a Malik Tillman free
OL,15,Fkick made a slight deflection off the
OL,16,Fwall and sent Belgian keeper Thibaut
OL,17,FCourtois the wrong way.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,FThe raucous crowd was quietened just
OL,7,Fminutes later however, with De
OL,8,FKetelaere nabbing his second goal
OL,9,Fthrough a perfectly headed cross in
OL,10,Fthe six-yard box.
OL,12,FThe Americans looked energised
OL,13,Ffollowing the half-time break,
OL,14,Fenjoying a wealth of possession in the
OL,15,Fearly stages but struggled to generate
OL,16,Fany real threatening chances.
OL,18,FTheir task got more difficult in the
OL,19,F57th minute when Belgium made the most
OL,20,Fof an unforced error.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,FUS goalkeeper Matt Freese came way off
OL,7,Fhis line to meet a long ball but his
OL,8,Fattempted kick only found the turf,
OL,9,Fwith the ball instead ending up in the
OL,10,Fpossession of Hans Vanaken, whose shot
OL,11,Fbeat defender Tim Ream and gave
OL,12,FBelgium some breathing room.
OL,14,FThe US were desperate to claw one
OL,15,Fback, and substitute Sebastian
OL,16,FBerhalter almost did just that with a
OL,17,Fshot from deep which just barely
OL,18,Fwhizzed past the left post.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,FHis attempt generated some much-needed
OL,7,Fmomentum for the US, who spent most of
OL,8,Fthe final stages of the match camped
OL,9,Fin their attacking third but could not
OL,10,Ffind the back of the net.
OL,12,FA Romelu Lukaku goal in added time was
OL,13,Fultimately the dagger in the heart for
OL,14,Fthe US, with Belgium progressing to a
OL,15,Fquarter-final clash with Spain.
OL,17,FBelgium coach Rudi Garcia told
OL,18,Ffifa.com after the game: "To everyone
OL,19,Fwho got up in the middle of the night
OL,20,Fto support us, I'd like to say a huge
OL,21,Fthank you.
OL,26,@zD@ZOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31807
