CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,F"They should be happy and proud of
OL,7,Ftheir players today. We showed that
OL,8,FBelgium is a great football nation."
OL,10,FUS coach Mauricio Pochettino said: "It
OL,11,Fwas really tough from the beginning.
OL,12,FWe congratulate Belgium, they were
OL,13,Fbetter than us. It wasn't our day.
OL,15,F"We need to learn, we need to assess
OL,16,Fthe game and understand why we did not
OL,17,Fapproach the game in the same way we
OL,18,Fdid as we did in the rest of the World
OL,19,FCup."
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@dO]rD@dOUwD@AOU{D@EO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/21
