OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,FGianni Infantino criticised over Trump
OL,7,Fphone call
OL,9,FSeveral big names in the football
OL,10,Fworld have since criticised Infantino
OL,11,Fover his apparent conversation with
OL,12,FTrump about Balogun's red card.
OL,14,FFormer Liverpool FC manager Jurgen
OL,15,FKlopp said, "This is our sport, not
OL,16,Ftheirs," according to a report by the
OL,17,FTelegraph.
OL,26,@vD@^xzwD@MOUxD@HO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,F"If Donald Trump and Gianni Infantino
OL,7,Freally sorted this out between
OL,8,Fthemselves, it is madness; it calls
OL,9,Feverything into question."
OL,11,FAppearing as a pundit for the BBC's
OL,12,Fcoverage of the tournament, former
OL,13,FManchester United and England forward
OL,14,FWayne Rooney did not mince his words
OL,15,Fwhen commenting on Infantino's
OL,16,Fdecision.
OL,18,F"I think it's an absolute disgrace, I
OL,19,Freally do," he told the broadcaster.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,F"For this to be suspended, they either
OL,7,Ftake the red card away which is
OL,8,Fprobably the right decision and then
OL,9,Fhe can play. But to suspend it for a
OL,10,Fyear? I think it's an absolute
OL,11,Fdisgrace. Infantino should be ashamed
OL,12,Fof this.
OL,14,F"The sportsmanship of this game is in
OL,15,Fquestion here. If I'm USA's opponent,
OL,16,FI'd be absolutely fuming. It's wrong
OL,17,Fin every way... Where does it stop?"
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC Radio 4's World at
OL,7,FOne programme on Monday, former
OL,8,FFootball Association chairman David
OL,9,FBernstein said: "This should really
OL,10,Fnot be allowed to stand because it's a
OL,11,Fchaotic thing to do.
OL,13,F"It sort of throws Fifa back to the
OL,14,FSep Blatter days. It's just
OL,15,Ffundamentally wrong and terrible for
OL,16,Ffootball and completely contrary to
OL,17,Fthe sort of positioning that Fifa
OL,18,Ftries to maintain.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G11/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,F"It's absolutely crucial that there is
OL,7,Fconsistency and that Fifa's
OL,8,Fpositioning is proper and consistent.
OL,10,F"A red card is a red card. We all see
OL,11,Fplenty of tough red cards... but
OL,12,Fthat's not a reason for political
OL,13,Finterference to overturn them. But of
OL,14,Fcourse, Fifa gave Trump a peace prize
OL,15,Fthe other month."
OL,17,FBeyond football, some politicians have
OL,18,Falso expressed their anger, including
OL,19,FLiberal Democrats leader Ed Davey, who
OL,20,Fposted on X: "Infantino must go.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G12/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31813
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,F"No matter where it's held, the World
OL,7,FCup belongs to the fans ` not
OL,8,Fgangsters like Trump. We need someone
OL,9,Fwho'll finally kick corruption out of
OL,10,FFIFA."
OL,12,FHow have Fifa and Infantino responded?
OL,14,FIn a statement released on Monday via
OL,15,FFifa's media department, Infantino
OL,16,Fsaid he would like to "reiterate a
OL,17,Ffundamental principle of Fifa's
OL,18,Fgovernance".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G13/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31814
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,F"Fifa's judicial bodies are
OL,7,Findependent. They operate
OL,8,Fautonomously, apply the FIFA
OL,9,FDisciplinary Code, and decide cases
OL,10,Fbased on the applicable regulations
OL,11,Fand the specific facts before them,"
OL,12,Fhe said.
OL,14,F"Their independence is essential to
OL,15,Fthe credibility and integrity of
OL,16,Ffootball, and this must always be
OL,17,Frespected.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G14/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31815
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,F"Yes, I regularly discuss matters
OL,7,Frelated to the Fifa World Cup with the
OL,8,FPresident of the United States, and on
OL,9,Fthis matter, I did receive a call from
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump, just as I
OL,11,Freceive calls from heads of state,
OL,12,Fgovernment officials, football
OL,13,Fstakeholders and business executives
OL,14,Ffrom around the world on many
OL,15,Fdifferent issues.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G15/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31816
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,F"During our conversation, I explained
OL,7,Fthat there was an ongoing legal
OL,8,Fprocess involving Fifa's independent
OL,9,Fjudicial bodies and that the case
OL,10,Fwould be decided in due course by the
OL,11,Fcompetent bodies.
OL,13,F"That is how Fifa's system works, and
OL,14,Fit is a principle that I will always
OL,15,Fuphold. I read the decisions of the
OL,16,FFifa Disciplinary Committee when they
OL,17,Fare issued. Sometimes I am surprised
OL,18,Fby them. Sometimes I agree with them,
OL,19,Fand sometimes I disagree.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G16/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31817
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,F"What I always do, however, is respect
OL,7,Fthose decisions and the autonomy of
OL,8,Fthe bodies that make them. Whether we
OL,9,Fpersonally like a decision or not is
OL,10,Firrelevant.
OL,12,F"Respect for independent institutions
OL,13,Fand the rule of law is what protects
OL,14,Fthe integrity of our competitions and
OL,15,Fthe credibility of FIFA at all times."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUwD@fO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G17/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31818
