CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,FA statement by the Chairperson of the
OL,7,FFifa Disciplinary Committee said that
OL,8,Fthe committee had decided to apply
OL,9,FArticle 27 of the FIFA Disciplinary
OL,10,FCode, "under which it has discretion
OL,11,Fto suspend the implementation of any
OL,12,Fdisciplinary measures".
OL,14,FThe committee "ordered that the
OL,15,Fimplementation of the one-match
OL,16,Fsuspension be suspended for a
OL,17,Fprobationary period of one year".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G18/21
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,319,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31819
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,F"The sanction remains dormant during
OL,7,Fthe probationary period and will only
OL,8,Fbe activated if he commits another
OL,9,Finfringement of a similar nature and
OL,10,Fgravity during that one-year period,"
OL,11,Fthe chairperson added.
OL,13,F"Reviewing the legal consequences of
OL,14,Fred cards in football is nothing new
OL,15,Fin the modern game," they said.
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G19/21
