OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F318A1783752523
OL,3,C'Overturn this': Belgium mock Trump
OL,4,Cafter knocking USA out of the World Cup
OL,6,F"For instance, in the majority of top-
OL,7,Ftier leagues belonging to UEFA-
OL,8,Faffiliated member associations ` the
OL,9,Foverturning of red cards is a common
OL,10,Fdisciplinary measure, yet this has
OL,11,Fnever raised concerns about crossing
OL,12,Fany 'red line'.
OL,14,F"It should be emphasised that in the
OL,15,Fdecision under scrutiny, the red card
OL,16,Fwas not overturned. Suspending the
OL,17,Feffects of a red card based on an
OL,18,Fexplicit provision of the applicable
OL,19,Fregulations is a much more balanced
OL,20,Fmeasure.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G20/21
